{"seq":4,"slug":"tokenization-and-embedding","title":"分词与嵌入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/foundations/tokenization-and-embedding","wordCount":1125,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"分词与嵌入\">分词与嵌入</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>从原始文本到模型可用的向量，中间经过四个层次的概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分词（Tokenization）</strong>：把文本切分为 token 并把每个 token 映射为词表 ID，是模型处理文本的第一步。</li>\n<li><strong>子词粒度</strong>：现代 LLM 几乎全部采用子词方案，在词表大小与序列长度之间取平衡；代表算法有 BPE、WordPiece、SentencePiece。</li>\n<li><strong>嵌入层</strong>：本质是可学习的查找表，把离散 token ID 映射为稠密向量（如 32000 × 768）。</li>\n<li><strong>静态 vs 上下文嵌入</strong>：Word2Vec 为每个词给出唯一固定向量、无法处理一词多义；Transformer 产生的嵌入随上下文变化，这是其相对静态嵌入的核心优势。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括这条流水线：<strong>分词决定「切多细」，嵌入决定「怎么用向量表示」，而上下文嵌入决定「同一个词在不同句子里能否不同」。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要分词\">为什么需要分词</h2><p>大语言模型不能直接处理原始文本，需要先将文本转换为数值表示。分词（Tokenization）是这个过程的第一步：将文本切分为模型可以理解的基本单元（token），然后通过嵌入层将每个 token 映射为稠密向量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;原始文本&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;分词器&lt;br/&gt;Tokenizer&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Token ID 序列&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;嵌入层&lt;br/&gt;Embedding&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;稠密向量序列&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"原始文本\"] --&gt; B[\"分词器&lt;br/&gt;Tokenizer\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Token ID 序列\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"嵌入层&lt;br/&gt;Embedding\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"稠密向量序列\"]</pre><p>分词粒度的选择直接影响模型的词表大小、序列长度和语义表达能力：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>词表大小</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>字符级</td>\n<td><code>[&#39;H&#39;,&#39;e&#39;,&#39;l&#39;,&#39;l&#39;,&#39;o&#39;]</code></td>\n<td>~100</td>\n<td>无 OOV</td>\n<td>序列过长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>词级</td>\n<td><code>[&#39;Hello&#39;, &#39;world&#39;]</code></td>\n<td>~100k+</td>\n<td>语义清晰</td>\n<td>OOV 问题严重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子词级</td>\n<td><code>[&#39;Hel&#39;, &#39;lo&#39;]</code></td>\n<td>~32k-128k</td>\n<td>平衡覆盖与长度</td>\n<td>需要训练</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 现代 LLM 几乎全部采用子词（subword）分词方案，在词表大小和序列长度之间取得最佳平衡。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"bpe-算法\">BPE 算法</h2><p>字节对编码（Byte Pair Encoding, BPE）是最广泛使用的子词分词算法。GPT 系列模型均采用 BPE 的变体。</p>\n<p>核心思路：从字符级别出发，反复合并出现频率最高的相邻 token 对，直到达到目标词表大小。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from collections import Counter&#10;&#10;def learn_bpe(corpus, num_merges):&#10;    words = [list(word) + [&#39;&lt;/w&gt;&#39;] for word in corpus]&#10;    merges = []&#10;&#10;    for i in range(num_merges):&#10;        pairs = Counter()&#10;        for word in words:&#10;            for j in range(len(word) - 1):&#10;                pairs[(word[j], word[j + 1])] += 1&#10;&#10;        if not pairs:&#10;            break&#10;&#10;        best_pair = pairs.most_common(1)[0][0]&#10;        merges.append(best_pair)&#10;&#10;        new_words = []&#10;        for word in words:&#10;            new_word = []&#10;            j = 0&#10;            while j &lt; len(word):&#10;                if j &lt; len(word) - 1 and (word[j], word[j + 1]) == best_pair:&#10;                    new_word.append(word[j] + word[j + 1])&#10;                    j += 2&#10;                else:&#10;                    new_word.append(word[j])&#10;                    j += 1&#10;            new_words.append(new_word)&#10;        words = new_words&#10;&#10;        print(f&quot;合并 {i + 1}: {best_pair[0]} + {best_pair[1]} → {best_pair[0] + best_pair[1]}&quot;)&#10;&#10;    return merges, words&#10;&#10;corpus = [&quot;low&quot;, &quot;lower&quot;, &quot;newest&quot;, &quot;widest&quot;, &quot;low&quot;, &quot;low&quot;]&#10;merges, result = learn_bpe(corpus, num_merges=5)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> collections </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Counter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> learn_bpe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(corpus, num_merges):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    words </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(word) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C;/w>'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> word </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> corpus]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    merges </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num_merges):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        pairs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Counter()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> word </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> words:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(word) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                pairs[(word[j], word[j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pairs:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        best_pair </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pairs.most_common(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        merges.append(best_pair)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        new_words </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> word </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> words:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            new_word </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(word):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(word) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (word[j], word[j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> best_pair:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    new_word.append(word[j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> word[j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    new_word.append(word[j])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            new_words.append(new_word)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        words </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> new_words</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"合并 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">best_pair[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> + </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">best_pair[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> → </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">best_pair[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> best_pair[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> merges, words</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">corpus </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"low\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lower\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"newest\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"widest\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"low\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"low\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">merges, result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> learn_bpe(corpus, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">num_merges</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    A[&quot;初始: l o w &lt;/w&gt;&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;合并 l+o → lo&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;lo w &lt;/w&gt;&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;合并 lo+w → low&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;low &lt;/w&gt;&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;合并 e+s → es&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;继续合并...&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    A[\"初始: l o w &lt;/w&gt;\"] --&gt; B[\"合并 l+o → lo\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"lo w &lt;/w&gt;\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"合并 lo+w → low\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"low &lt;/w&gt;\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"合并 e+s → es\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"继续合并...\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"wordpiece-与-sentencepiece\">WordPiece 与 SentencePiece</h2><h3 id=\"wordpiece\">WordPiece</h3><p>WordPiece 是 BERT 使用的分词算法，与 BPE 类似但使用不同的合并策略——选择使语言模型似然最大化的 token 对进行合并：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>freq</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mtext>freq</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mtext>freq</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(a, b) = \\frac{\\text{freq}(ab)}{\\text{freq}(a) \\times \\text{freq}(b)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">freq</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">freq</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">freq</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ab</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>WordPiece 使用 <code>##</code> 前缀标记非首子词：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from transformers import BertTokenizer&#10;&#10;tokenizer = BertTokenizer.from_pretrained(&#39;bert-base-uncased&#39;)&#10;tokens = tokenizer.tokenize(&quot;unbelievable transformers&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;WordPiece 分词: {tokens}&quot;)&#10;# [&#39;un&#39;, &#39;##bel&#39;, &#39;##ie&#39;, &#39;##va&#39;, &#39;##ble&#39;, &#39;transform&#39;, &#39;##ers&#39;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BertTokenizer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tokenizer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BertTokenizer.from_pretrained(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bert-base-uncased'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tokenizer.tokenize(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"unbelievable transformers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"WordPiece 分词: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tokens</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ['un', '##bel', '##ie', '##va', '##ble', 'transform', '##ers']</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"sentencepiece\">SentencePiece</h3><p>SentencePiece 是语言无关的分词工具，直接在原始文本（包括空格）上训练，无需预分词。它支持 BPE 和 Unigram 两种算法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>BPE</th>\n<th>WordPiece</th>\n<th>SentencePiece</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>训练方式</td>\n<td>频率合并</td>\n<td>似然最大化</td>\n<td>直接建模原始文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空格处理</td>\n<td>预分词</td>\n<td>预分词</td>\n<td>将空格视为特殊字符 ▁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表模型</td>\n<td>GPT, LLaMA</td>\n<td>BERT</td>\n<td>T5, LLaMA, Qwen</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言依赖</td>\n<td>依赖预分词</td>\n<td>依赖预分词</td>\n<td>语言无关</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# pip install sentencepiece&#10;import sentencepiece as spm&#10;&#10;# spm.SentencePieceTrainer.train(&#10;#     input=&#39;corpus.txt&#39;,&#10;#     model_prefix=&#39;sp_model&#39;,&#10;#     vocab_size=32000,&#10;#     model_type=&#39;bpe&#39;&#10;# )&#10;&#10;# sp = spm.SentencePieceProcessor(model_file=&#39;sp_model.model&#39;)&#10;# tokens = sp.encode(&#39;Hello world&#39;, out_type=str)&#10;# print(f&quot;SentencePiece 分词: {tokens}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># pip install sentencepiece</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sentencepiece </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> spm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># spm.SentencePieceTrainer.train(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     input='corpus.txt',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     model_prefix='sp_model',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     vocab_size=32000,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     model_type='bpe'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># sp = spm.SentencePieceProcessor(model_file='sp_model.model')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># tokens = sp.encode('Hello world', out_type=str)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># print(f\"SentencePiece 分词: {tokens}\")</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> LLaMA 系列使用 SentencePiece 的 BPE 模式进行分词，词表大小为 32,000。Qwen 使用基于字节的 BPE，词表大小约 150,000，对中文有更好的覆盖。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"词嵌入基础\">词嵌入基础</h2><p>分词后的 token ID 需要映射为稠密的低维向量，这就是嵌入（Embedding）。嵌入层本质上是一个可学习的查找表：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;vocab_size = 32000&#10;d_model = 768&#10;embedding = nn.Embedding(vocab_size, d_model)&#10;&#10;token_ids = torch.tensor([101, 2054, 2003, 1996, 102])&#10;vectors = embedding(token_ids)&#10;print(f&quot;输入形状: {token_ids.shape}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;嵌入输出形状: {vectors.shape}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;每个 token 的向量维度: {d_model}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">vocab_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 32000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 768</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">embedding </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Embedding(vocab_size, d_model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">token_ids </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.tensor([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">101</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2054</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2003</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1996</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">102</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">vectors </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> embedding(token_ids)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"输入形状: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">token_ids.shape</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"嵌入输出形状: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">vectors.shape</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"每个 token 的向量维度: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d_model</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"word2vec-的启示\">Word2Vec 的启示</h3><p>在 Transformer 之前，Word2Vec 是最有影响力的词嵌入方法。它通过预测上下文（CBOW）或中心词（Skip-gram）来学习词向量：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph CBOW[&quot;CBOW: 上下文预测中心词&quot;]&#10;        C1[&quot;the&quot;] --&gt; P1[&quot;预测&quot;]&#10;        C2[&quot;cat&quot;] --&gt; P1&#10;        C3[&quot;on&quot;] --&gt; P1&#10;        C4[&quot;the&quot;] --&gt; P1&#10;        P1 --&gt; W1[&quot;sat&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Skip-gram[&quot;Skip-gram: 中心词预测上下文&quot;]&#10;        W2[&quot;sat&quot;] --&gt; P2[&quot;预测&quot;]&#10;        P2 --&gt; C5[&quot;the&quot;]&#10;        P2 --&gt; C6[&quot;cat&quot;]&#10;        P2 --&gt; C7[&quot;on&quot;]&#10;        P2 --&gt; C8[&quot;the&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph CBOW[\"CBOW: 上下文预测中心词\"]\n        C1[\"the\"] --&gt; P1[\"预测\"]\n        C2[\"cat\"] --&gt; P1\n        C3[\"on\"] --&gt; P1\n        C4[\"the\"] --&gt; P1\n        P1 --&gt; W1[\"sat\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Skip-gram[\"Skip-gram: 中心词预测上下文\"]\n        W2[\"sat\"] --&gt; P2[\"预测\"]\n        P2 --&gt; C5[\"the\"]\n        P2 --&gt; C6[\"cat\"]\n        P2 --&gt; C7[\"on\"]\n        P2 --&gt; C8[\"the\"]\n    end</pre><p>Word2Vec 的局限在于每个词只有一个固定向量，无法处理一词多义。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"上下文嵌入\">上下文嵌入</h2><p>与 Word2Vec 的静态嵌入不同，Transformer 产生的嵌入是上下文相关的——同一个词在不同句子中有不同的向量表示：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>嵌入类型</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n<th>一词多义</th>\n<th>训练方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静态嵌入</td>\n<td>Word2Vec, GloVe</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>浅层预训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文嵌入</td>\n<td>BERT, GPT</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>深层 Transformer</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from transformers import AutoTokenizer, AutoModel&#10;import torch&#10;&#10;tokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(&quot;bert-base-uncased&quot;)&#10;model = AutoModel.from_pretrained(&quot;bert-base-uncased&quot;)&#10;&#10;sentences = [&quot;bank of the river&quot;, &quot;bank account balance&quot;]&#10;for sent in sentences:&#10;    inputs = tokenizer(sent, return_tensors=&quot;pt&quot;)&#10;    with torch.no_grad():&#10;        outputs = model(**inputs)&#10;    bank_idx = (inputs[&#39;input_ids&#39;][0] == tokenizer.convert_tokens_to_ids(&#39;bank&#39;)).nonzero()[0]&#10;    bank_vec = outputs.last_hidden_state[0, bank_idx]&#10;    print(f&quot;&#39;{sent}&#39; 中 &#39;bank&#39; 的嵌入范数: {bank_vec.norm().item():.4f}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoTokenizer, AutoModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tokenizer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bert-base-uncased\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModel.from_pretrained(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bert-base-uncased\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sentences </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bank of the river\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bank account balance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sentences:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    inputs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tokenizer(sent, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">return_tensors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.no_grad():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        outputs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">inputs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bank_idx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (inputs[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'input_ids'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tokenizer.convert_tokens_to_ids(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bank'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).nonzero()[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bank_vec </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outputs.last_hidden_state[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, bank_idx]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sent</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">' 中 'bank' 的嵌入范数: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bank_vec.norm().item()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 LLM 中，输入 token 经过嵌入层后会加上位置编码，然后送入多层 Transformer。每一层的输出都是更高层次的上下文嵌入，最后一层的输出被用于预测下一个 token。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>子词分词（BPE、WordPiece、SentencePiece）在词表大小和序列长度之间取得最佳平衡。</li>\n<li>BPE 通过频率驱动的合并策略构建词表，是 GPT 和 LLaMA 的基础。</li>\n<li>SentencePiece 提供语言无关的分词方案，直接在原始文本上训练。</li>\n<li>嵌入层将离散 token 映射为稠密向量，是模型理解文本的第一步。</li>\n<li>上下文嵌入是 Transformer 相比静态嵌入的核心优势，使模型能够区分一词多义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分词与嵌入","id":"分词与嵌入"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要分词","id":"为什么需要分词"},{"level":2,"text":"BPE 算法","id":"bpe-算法"},{"level":2,"text":"WordPiece 与 SentencePiece","id":"wordpiece-与-sentencepiece"},{"level":3,"text":"WordPiece","id":"wordpiece"},{"level":3,"text":"SentencePiece","id":"sentencepiece"},{"level":2,"text":"词嵌入基础","id":"词嵌入基础"},{"level":3,"text":"Word2Vec 的启示","id":"word2vec-的启示"},{"level":2,"text":"上下文嵌入","id":"上下文嵌入"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"注意力机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/foundations/attention-mechanism"},"next":{"title":"预训练目标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/pretraining-and-alignment/pretraining-objectives"}}